{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04074","headline":"奉和圣制经河上公庙应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制经河上公庙应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河流无日夜，河上有神仙。\n辇路曾经此，坛场即宛然。\n下疑成洞穴，高若在空烟。\n善物遗方外，和光绕道边。\n事因周史得，言与汉王传。\n喜属膺期圣，邦家业又玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}